1 NOTE The first Bundervoet of the line born in Oostende (1905); eldest child of Petrus Franciscus Bundervoet & Augusta Vanstechelman.
2 CONT
2 CONT CORROBORATED (July 2026), twice over. Two unrelated heemkring collections —
2 CONT Familiekunde Vlaanderen Westkust and Spaenhiers — each hold a memorial-card record
2 CONT giving birth 6 January 1905 at Oostende, death 11 March 1980 at Oostende, and spouse
2 CONT Elodia Bostyn. Two independent indexes, the same four facts.
2 CONT
2 CONT Stays `sup`: both are transcriptions. The Spaenhiers index publishes as a PDF of card
2 CONT listings rather than card images, so there is still nothing here anyone has read.
