1 NOTE Joannes Bundervoet's SECOND wife (married ~1745, died 1750) — NOT the mother of
2 CONT Christoffel or Pieter; both were by his first wife, Livina Stockman. Several trees
2 CONT confuse the two wives.
2 CONT
2 CONT GIVEN NAME DISPUTED. This record calls her Livina; the paulderidder tree calls her
2 CONT **Joanna de Wilde**, and gives her no dates at all — the 1750 death here comes from
2 CONT glorieuxp. Both trees are cited below, and they do not agree, so the name is held
2 CONT loosely: "Livina" is what this record has always said and is kept for stability, but it
2 CONT is not settled. The confusion is easy to see how it started, since the first wife was
2 CONT also a Livina. FRONTIER: the ~1745 Evergem marriage act would name her outright and
2 CONT settle it.
